# ── Environment / Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NEVER commit secrets. Safe values belong in .env (non-secret VITE_ vars only).
# All secrets (API keys, service role keys, DB passwords) go in .env.local.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
# Example files contain only placeholder values (YOUR_XXX_HERE) — they are safe
# to commit, but are listed here as a reminder to check before committing.
# .env.exampleLocal
# .env.exampleProd

